      {
        "Id": "0123c161963848b3888ea5e36e3086c6",
        "Title": "HOW TO USE  -  switch ON only what you want, then Run\n1 SLAB: nothing to select. Levels blank = top of the columns, or type L2, L3 / L2..L10 / ALL. Re-run = slab updated (replaced).\n2 WALLS: select 2 columns (one wall) or a row / group of columns (a wall in every bay), set thickness + height, Run.\n3 COPY: select any elements (walls, columns, beams, slabs, footings...), type target levels, Run. Already copied = skipped.\n4 REMOVE deletes only slabs / walls made by this tool.   Log: %APPDATA%\\pyRevit\\CAD2BIM_dynamo_log.txt",
        "DescriptionText": null,
        "IsExpanded": true,
        "WidthAdjustment": 0.0,
        "HeightAdjustment": 0.0,
